                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr. Conger</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-12-23"><hi rendition="#italic">December 23,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Protest French extension if against American interests.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hay</hi>.</signed></closer>


